{"4883760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wrong Landing: Reborn", "steam_appid": 4883760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wrong Landing: Reborn</strong> is a brand new, bigger version of the original survival game. It is not just a sequel—it is a fresh start on a dangerous, mysterious island full of surprises. Play alone or team up with your friends in co-op mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are lost in a huge open world, and you must survive the harsh nature while uncovering deep secrets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Together (Co-op):</strong> Don't face the danger alone. Survive with your friends and help each other stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real Survival:</strong> Watch your food, temperature an all stats. Don't starve and don't freeze to death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Island:</strong> Explore a big open world full of surprises, hidden places, and dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Story:</strong> This is not just about staying alive. Follow an interesting story and find out the truth about this strange place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Better Than Before:</strong> A complete remake of the original idea with new features and a better atmosphere.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wrong Landing: Reborn</strong> is a brand new, bigger version of the original survival game. It is not just a sequel—it is a fresh start on a dangerous, mysterious island full of surprises. Play alone or team up with your friends in co-op mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are lost in a huge open world, and you must survive the harsh nature while uncovering deep secrets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Together (Co-op):</strong> Don't face the danger alone. Survive with your friends and help each other stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real Survival:</strong> Watch your food, temperature an all stats. Don't starve and don't freeze to death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Island:</strong> Explore a big open world full of surprises, hidden places, and dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Story:</strong> This is not just about staying alive. Follow an interesting story and find out the truth about this strange place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Better Than Before:</strong> A complete remake of the original idea with new features and a better atmosphere.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Wrong Landing: Reborn is a new, improved open-world survival game. Explore a mysterious island full of surprises alone or with friends! Discover its rich story, fight hunger, extreme cold, and try to stay alive.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883760/9e499fbdbd9c41d53e3e3a8b45f87d3327bc01b9/header.jpg?t=1786562930", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883760/4817dcd14ab065837d98b3b84439dd907ac81b60/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786562930", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883760/4817dcd14ab065837d98b3b84439dd907ac81b60/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786562930", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core I5-4440 3,10 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["BigUpdate Games"], "publishers": ["BigUpdate Games"], 